### 🔐 Login como Administrador
POST https://localhost:7181/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@starkaid.com",
  "password": "StarkAdmin2024@"
}

###

### 🔄 Refresh Token (substitua o valor depois de obter um refresh token válido)
POST https://localhost:7181/api/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "COLE_SEU_REFRESH_TOKEN_AQUI"
}

###

### 🔒 Acesso exclusivo Administrador
GET https://localhost:7181/api/admin/admin-only
Authorization: Bearer COLE_SEU_TOKEN_JWT_AQUI

###

### 📥 Criar novo usuário (exemplo)
POST https://localhost:7181/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João Tester",
  "email": "joao@tester.com",
  "password": "SenhaF0rte!"
}

###

### 📜 Listar todos os usuários (se implementado)
GET https://localhost:7181/api/users
Authorization: Bearer COLE_SEU_TOKEN_JWT_AQUI